@startuml SSD_09_Load_Stage_Map
title SSD-09 스테이지 입장 - 맵 생성
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: enterStage(stageId)
System -> System: loadStageMap(stageId)
alt 맵 로드 성공
  System --> Player: spawnAvatar(spawnPoint)
  System --> Player: stageReady(stageId)
else 네트워크/로드 실패
  System --> Player: returnToLobbyWithError(reason)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_10_Operate_Lever
title SSD-10 기믹 수행 - 레버 작동
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: operateLever(leverId)
System -> System: validateInteractable(leverId, playerPosition)
alt 레버 작동 가능
  System --> Player: leverDeactivated(leverId)
  System --> Player: linkedStructureActivated(structureId)
else 이미 작동됨 또는 조건 미충족
  System --> Player: interactionIgnored(reason)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_11_Operate_Button
title SSD-11 기믹 수행 - 버튼 작동
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: operateButton(buttonId)
System -> System: validateInteractable(buttonId, playerPosition)
alt 작동 가능
  System --> Player: bridgeStateToggled(activeSet)
else 거리 초과
  System --> Player: interactionIgnored(reason)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_12_Clear_Final_Gimmick
title SSD-12 최종 기믹 해결 및 스테이지 클리어
actor "플레이어 A" as PlayerA
actor "플레이어 B" as PlayerB
participant "Game System" as System

PlayerA -> System: stepOnPressurePlate(plateA)
PlayerB -> System: stepOnPressurePlate(plateB)
System -> System: validateFinalGimmick()
alt 두 발판 모두 활성화
  System --> PlayerA: exitOpened()
  System --> PlayerB: exitOpened()
end

PlayerA -> System: enterExitArea()
PlayerB -> System: enterExitArea()
System -> System: validateAllPlayersExited()
alt 모든 플레이어가 출구 진입
  System --> PlayerA: stageCleared()
  System --> PlayerB: stageCleared()
else 일부 플레이어 미진입
  System --> PlayerA: waitForPartner()
  System --> PlayerB: waitForPartner()
end
@enduml
